-- D-03 real Deleted session for ProjAMS.
-- Target is VTWA 24381/107146 under BRAN 24381/107104, dbnum 7997.
-- VTWA belongs to the INLINE change class, which no test case has covered yet.
--
-- The element is NOT recreated afterwards: refnos are never reissued, so the
-- rollback path is the file backup taken before this macro runs, restored while
-- E3D holds no claim on the database:
--   D:/AVEVA/Projects/E3D3.1/AvevaMarineSample/ams000/ams7997_0001.codex-before-d03-delete-20260727
--
-- Baseline to diff against: docs/evidence/2026-07-27-d03-delete-session-baseline.md
--
-- Run through l3_suite's fresh single-purpose wrapper, so that SAVEWORK commits
-- this deletion and nothing else. The wrapper owns the L3-DONE sentinel and QUIT.
-- It also works typed into an E3D Design Command Window, but then SAVEWORK
-- would fold any other pending edits of that session into the same session
-- number and the window would no longer isolate the deletion.

ALPHA LOG "D:/work/plant-code/old/gen-model/scripts/e3d/projams_incr_delete_apply.log" OVER
$P CODEX-D03-DELETE-ALIVE
=24381/107146
Q CE
Q TYPE
Q OWNE
Q SPRE
DELETE VTWA
Q CE
SAVEWORK 'CODEX D-03 delete VTWA 24381/107146'
$P CODEX-D03-DELETE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
